  plt launch <workflow> --input k=v ...     compile: create the first step task(s)
  plt advance [--run ID | --all]            advance launched runs (cron calls this)
  plt runs                                  list run states
  plt run launch <id> --cycle <name>        start a process-spine run from a cycle formula; a formula that
                                             fails validation (overlay merged with its base) refuses, naming file:line
  plt run recompile <id>        refresh unfinished steps' requirements from formula + config (validated the same way)
