  plt menu words [--run <run>]              print the effective menu word map (config.menu.words override, else defaults)
  plt menu json [--run <run>]               print the current run's {mode, phrases}
  plt pin [--repo <dir>]                    compute the current pin for a repo
  plt config [key.path] [--run <run>]       print the merged process/config as JSON, or one value by dotted path
  plt integration install|status <name> [--project <dir>] [--load]
                                             install the spine's <name> integration (claude: hooks, agent,
                                             settings; timers: the launchd/systemd \`plt watch --once\` timer,
                                             --load to also launchctl/systemctl-enable it) into a project,
                                             or report its state
  plt effort plan <slug> [--json]           plan the parallel wave for an effort's cards
  plt effort launch <slug> [--parallel] [--dry-run] [--only ID,ID] [--owner who]
